=== j8-1: a range on d; the body root scans j8_o_d ===
== Explain Query ==
body root: scanIndex on j8_o_d, 1 bound
== Query ==
WITH c AS (SELECT o.k AS k, COUNT(*) AS n, SUM(l.x) AS s
FROM j8_o AS o JOIN j8_l AS l ON l.ok = o.id
WHERE o.d >= 60
GROUP BY o.k)
SELECT COUNT(*) AS g, SUM(c.n) AS sn, SUM(c.s) AS ss FROM c;

Number of output lines, including header: 2

